flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Choose{Choose workload source}
    Choose --> Manual[Enter process manually]
    Choose --> Sample[Load sample CSV]
    Choose --> Import[Import CSV]
    Choose --> Generate[Generate workload]
    Manual --> Validate[Validate workload]
    Sample --> Validate
    Import --> Validate
    Generate --> Validate
    Validate --> Valid{Valid?}
    Valid -- No --> Error[Display validation error]
    Error --> Choose
    Valid -- Yes --> Inspect[View workload statistics]
    Inspect --> Action{Next action}
    Action --> Simulate[Select scheduling algorithm]
    Action --> Compare[Compare algorithms]
    Simulate --> Run[Scheduler runs simulation]
    Compare --> RunComparison[Scheduler runs each algorithm]
    Run --> Report[Analysis formats report]
    RunComparison --> ComparisonReport[Analysis formats comparison]
    Report --> Export{Export result?}
    ComparisonReport --> Export
    Export -- Yes --> File[Write text report]
    Export -- No --> End([End or return to menu])
    File --> End
